{"version":1,"key":"card:12","content":{"id":12,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果一个值可能是多种类型中的某一个，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"|","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将类型连接起来"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"type StrOrNum = string | number;\nconst s: StrOrNum = \"1\";\nconst n: StrOrNum = 1;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f765a71c-20d1-4b0c-8255-45886497f27a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以在联合类型中进一步嵌套联合类型，但这些嵌套的联合类型最终都会被展平到第一级中"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const d: StrOrNum | bool = false;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8d2e82a7-9fc8-469a-8c62-4a656b822ceb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在不知道具体是什么类型之前，我们只能调用二者的公共属性或方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"interface Obj1 {\n  type: 'obj1',\n  eat: () => void;\n}\n\n\ninterface Obj2 {\n  type: 'obj2',\n  jump: () => void;\n}\n\n\ntype Obj = Obj1 | Obj2;\n\n\nconst obj: Obj = {\n  type: 'obj1',\n  eat: () => {\n    console.log('eat');\n  }\n};\n\n\n// 即使你知道它是 Obj1 类型，你也只能访问公共的属性 `type`\n// 无法调用 `eat` 函数\nconsole.log(obj.type);\n// obj.eat()","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"ed2b94d4-8f84-4035-821b-7d8f5906454b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果想调用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"eat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，你要断言 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"obj","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Obj1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"(obj as Obj1).eat();","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"35d90e3a-228c-4a87-8ef7-3c4ee02b35e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"或者判断 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"type","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，TypeScript 或进行"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":137,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":142,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型收缩"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"if (obj.type === 'obj1') {\n  // 如果进入这里，此时 TypeScript 知道 obj 的类型是 Obj1\n  obj.eat();\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f4aa2db2-5295-4810-b924-4511d1ac5f27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/联合","TypeScript/数据类型"],"createTime":1688912347270,"updateTime":1754032832401,"linkedCards":[{"id":9,"target":{"key":"card:9","type":"card","id":9},"summary":"联合类型作为泛型传递时，其内容会进行分发 // 2 type A = string | number extends number ? 1 : 2; type B<T> = T extends number ? 1 : 2; // 1 | ...","tags":["TypeScript/联合","TypeScript/分布式特性"]},{"id":20,"target":{"key":"card:20","type":"card","id":20},"summary":"有的时候我们需要更加精确的类型，例如服务接口返回的 code 字段，它的值是 0 或者 1 ，这种时候应如何声明类型 interface Response { code: number; status: string; } 如果直接声明为 ...","tags":["TypeScript/联合"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754032832401},"links":{"card:142":{"key":"card:142","type":"card","id":142}}}